-preview/_img/76ff90900867dc3a.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/76ff90900867dc3a.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/76ff90900867dc3a.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/76ff90900867dc3a.webp 720w",743,"Mary Beth Westmoreland","ld21116k0xfpa83xhcv76gijr","沃尔玛第三方市场增速创近年最快，一季度同比增长近50%","沃尔玛美国第三方市场在2027财年第一季度（截至2026年4月30日）同比增长近50%，为两年半来最高增速。其市场GMV估计约150亿美元，约占其美国电商业务1500亿美元的10%，而亚马逊美国GMV约4400亿美元中第三方占比估计为69%。沃尔玛当季通过WFS发货的当日或次日达商品增长近150%，Walmart Connect广告收入（不含VIZIO）增长44%，第三方广告支出增长超50%。",{"_106":294},"2026-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","2026-09-30T10:08:14.697Z",[104,167,293,105],{"_98":291,"_100":292},[287],{"_86":87,"_88":288,"_90":289,"_92":290,"_94":-5,"_95":-5,"_96":-5,"_97":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/54e253ab03166816.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/54e253ab03166816.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/54e253ab03166816.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/54e253ab03166816.webp 720w","Ben Donovan","Marketplace Pulse","多平台销售","Marketplace Pulse · Ben Donovan","fezuxvorbfp6iis7zni4o23vl","TikTok Shop 数据：1% 卖家贡献 60% GMV","Marketplace Pulse 对近 10 万名美国 TikTok Shop 卖家的早期数据显示，前 1% 卖家贡献了 60% 的 GMV，前 0.1%（不足 90 名卖家，人均终身销售额超 1 亿美元）占超四分之一。",{"_106":294},"2026-06-11T00:00:00.000Z","2026-09-30T10:08:14.681Z",[166,167,104,293,105],43,{"_98":291,"_100":292},[305],{"_86":87,"_88":306,"_90":307,"_92":308,"_94":-5,"_95":-5,"_96":-5,"_97":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/fe2d5f8b2037a8e9.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/fe2d5f8b2037a8e9.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/fe2d5f8b2037a8e9.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/fe2d5f8b2037a8e9.webp 720w","trdlibzdwoow9baydrqar3ban","Marketplace Pulse：TikTok Shop热销品三分之二收入来自身体相关产品","Marketplace Pulse 追踪超两百万商品后统计，TikTok Shop 美国站历史销量前 1000 名商品中，超过三分之二的收入来自涂抹、服用或穿戴在身体上的产品。",{"_106":294},"2026-06-18T00:00:00.000Z","2026-09-30T10:08:14.665Z",[104,167,166,293,105],60,{"_98":291,"_100":292},[319],{"_86":87,"_88":320,"_90":321,"_92":322,"_94":-5,"_95":-5,"_96":-5,"_97":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/86493fb5b871c323.